OL,3,CMan dies after falling from city
OL,4,Ccentre building
OL,6,FA man has died after falling from a
OL,7,Fbuilding.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to Duke
OL,10,FStreet, in Liverpool, at around 9pm on
OL,11,FTuesday, 4 August, after with reports
OL,12,Fa person had fallen.
OL,14,FMerseyside Police said the man
OL,15,Fsustained serious injuries following
OL,16,Fthe fall, and died at the scene a
OL,17,Fshort time later.
OL,19,FThe force confirmed the man's death is
OL,20,Fnot being treated as suspicious and
OL,21,Fhis next of kin have been informed.
